{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02499","headline":"冬日宴于庶子宅各赋一字得平 · 岑文本","name":"冬日宴于庶子宅各赋一字得平","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金兰笃惠好，尊酒畅生平。\n既欣投辖赏，暂缓望乡情。\n爱景含霜晦，落照带风轻。\n於兹欢宴洽，宠辱讵相惊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑文本","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02499.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02499","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}